values ($q$7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1$q$, $q$speak-and-breathe$q$, $q$Speak & Breathe — Gestion du stress et prise de parole en public$q$, $q$Speak & Breathe — Stress control and public speaking$q$, $q$Deux ateliers animés par des professionnelles de la psychologie pour mieux gérer son stress et prendre la parole avec confiance.$q$, $q$Two workshops led by psychology professionals to manage stress and speak with confidence.$q$, $q$Faculté de médecine, Tlemcen$q$, $q$2026-05-05 13:00+01$q$, $q$2026-05-06 12:00+01$q$, $q$https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/00cf391b-de59-5493-a189-378c844de9a4.webp$q$, $q$Les participantes et l'intervenante de l'atelier Speak & Breathe$q$, $q${"x": 50, "y": 50}$q$::jsonb, $q${"primary": "#0e7490", "accent": "#2d74ba", "background": "#ffffff", "text": "#231f20", "font": "sans", "radius": "round", "header": "gradient", "headerLayout": "fullBleed", "overlay": 45}$q$::jsonb, false, 0, $q$[{"value": "2", "label_fr": "ateliers pratiques", "label_en": "hands-on workshops", "icon": "users"}, {"value": "2", "label_fr": "intervenantes en psychologie", "label_en": "psychology speakers", "icon": "stethoscope"}]$q$::jsonb, array[$q$Atelier$q$, $q$Développement personnel$q$, $q$Psychologie$q$]::text[], $q${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Speak smart, shine bright.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Avec Speak & Breathe, le club a proposé deux ateliers pour apprendre à apprivoiser le stress et à prendre la parole avec assurance — des compétences essentielles pour les études comme pour la future pratique médicale."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Deux ateliers"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Stress Control", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " — 5 mai, 13 h–16 h, avec Amina Bouhadjer, psychothérapeute : comprendre l'effet du stress sur le corps, apprendre des techniques efficaces et le transformer en source d'énergie."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Public Speaking", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " — 6 mai, 9 h–12 h, avec Radjaa Dahmani, spécialiste en psychologie : surmonter le trac, maîtriser sa voix et son langage corporel, construire un style de prise de parole authentique."}]}]}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/e899387f-b6e7-5808-9f81-396b1e10f1ca.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 1", "caption": "", "mediaId": "e899387f-b6e7-5808-9f81-396b1e10f1ca"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/dd300397-f0b1-5ce0-8b59-cfe2029df137.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 2", "caption": "", "mediaId": "dd300397-f0b1-5ce0-8b59-cfe2029df137"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 2}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Retour en images"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Des participantes qui ont appris, échangé et pris confiance dans une atmosphère bienveillante."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/69530a3e-ad8f-59da-9690-78a4eb255c30.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 3", "caption": "", "mediaId": "69530a3e-ad8f-59da-9690-78a4eb255c30"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/b51ea6ab-31e3-5dc4-b68f-b65bcb9145db.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 4", "caption": "", "mediaId": "b51ea6ab-31e3-5dc4-b68f-b65bcb9145db"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/fe928c3d-a748-5c85-af70-d6b17ce40c0f.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 5", "caption": "", "mediaId": "fe928c3d-a748-5c85-af70-d6b17ce40c0f"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/eda087f0-413c-5308-ab70-20c1250cf079.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 6", "caption": "", "mediaId": "eda087f0-413c-5308-ab70-20c1250cf079"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/d0008cfd-6751-5a38-b99a-082e1189e0d7.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 7", "caption": "", "mediaId": "d0008cfd-6751-5a38-b99a-082e1189e0d7"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/1904d55e-e1c0-5071-ba1c-30b6af174992.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 8", "caption": "", "mediaId": "1904d55e-e1c0-5071-ba1c-30b6af174992"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Un immense merci à nos intervenantes pour leur savoir, leur énergie et leurs précieux conseils. Nous continuerons à créer des espaces où l'apprentissage rencontre l'inspiration."}]}]}$q$::jsonb, $q${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Speak smart, shine bright.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " With Speak & Breathe, the club offered two workshops on taming stress and speaking with confidence — essential skills for studying and for future medical practice."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Two workshops"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Stress Control", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " — May 5, 1–4 pm, with Amina Bouhadjer, psychotherapist: understanding how stress affects the body, learning effective techniques and turning it into a source of energy."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Public Speaking", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " — May 6, 9 am–12 pm, with Radjaa Dahmani, psychology specialist: overcoming stage fright, mastering voice and body language, building an authentic speaking style."}]}]}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/e899387f-b6e7-5808-9f81-396b1e10f1ca.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 1", "caption": "", "mediaId": "e899387f-b6e7-5808-9f81-396b1e10f1ca"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/dd300397-f0b1-5ce0-8b59-cfe2029df137.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 2", "caption": "", "mediaId": "dd300397-f0b1-5ce0-8b59-cfe2029df137"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 2}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "In pictures"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Participants learned, exchanged and grew in confidence in a supportive atmosphere."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/69530a3e-ad8f-59da-9690-78a4eb255c30.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 3", "caption": "", "mediaId": "69530a3e-ad8f-59da-9690-78a4eb255c30"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/b51ea6ab-31e3-5dc4-b68f-b65bcb9145db.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 4", "caption": "", "mediaId": "b51ea6ab-31e3-5dc4-b68f-b65bcb9145db"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/fe928c3d-a748-5c85-af70-d6b17ce40c0f.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 5", "caption": "", "mediaId": "fe928c3d-a748-5c85-af70-d6b17ce40c0f"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/eda087f0-413c-5308-ab70-20c1250cf079.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 6", "caption": "", "mediaId": "eda087f0-413c-5308-ab70-20c1250cf079"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/d0008cfd-6751-5a38-b99a-082e1189e0d7.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 7", "caption": "", "mediaId": "d0008cfd-6751-5a38-b99a-082e1189e0d7"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/7685eb82-7d30-52bf-a397-0a84f96875d1/1904d55e-e1c0-5071-ba1c-30b6af174992.webp", "alt": "Speak & Breathe — photo 8", "caption": "", "mediaId": "1904d55e-e1c0-5071-ba1c-30b6af174992"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A heartfelt thank you to our speakers for their knowledge, energy and valuable advice. We will keep creating spaces where learning meets inspiration."}]}]}$q$::jsonb, $q${"instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DYDUI4VjSRM/"}$q$::jsonb, 'draft')
