values ($q$9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400$q$, $q$stitch-it-up-3$q$, $q$Stitch It Up 3 — Formation pratique en gestes médicaux$q$, $q$Stitch It Up 3 — Hands-on medical skills training$q$, $q$Trois jours de pratique : injections et prélèvements, secourisme, sutures chirurgicales et conseil en pharmacie.$q$, $q$Three days of practice: injections and blood draws, first aid, surgical sutures and pharmacy counselling.$q$, $q$Tlemcen$q$, $q$2026-04-20 09:00+01$q$, $q$2026-04-23 17:00+01$q$, $q$https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/0ab1f3d1-e567-56e5-b966-3a357022244c.webp$q$, $q$Des participantes s'entraînent aux sutures sur des pads de simulation$q$, $q${"x": 50, "y": 50}$q$::jsonb, $q${}$q$::jsonb, true, 3, $q$[{"value": "3", "label_fr": "jours de formation", "label_en": "days of training", "icon": "calendar"}, {"value": "4", "label_fr": "modules pratiques", "label_en": "hands-on modules", "icon": "stethoscope"}, {"value": "3e", "label_fr": "édition", "label_en": "edition", "icon": "award"}]$q$::jsonb, array[$q$Formation$q$, $q$Secourisme$q$, $q$Sutures$q$]::text[], $q${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pour sa "}, {"type": "text", "text": "3e édition", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", Stitch It Up a réuni étudiants et formateurs autour d'un objectif simple : apprendre les gestes en les pratiquant. Entre le sérieux des simulations et les fous rires entre deux exercices, chacun est reparti avec des compétences solides."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Jour 1 — Injections, prélèvements et secourisme"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Une journée pour maîtriser les techniques d'injection et de prélèvement, puis les gestes de premiers secours : position latérale de sécurité, massage cardiaque et conduite à tenir en urgence."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/42d431d3-b6d7-5351-b73c-bd507d3bc2ac.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 1", "caption": "", "mediaId": "42d431d3-b6d7-5351-b73c-bd507d3bc2ac"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/dda0efe8-79b1-5bfd-978a-ab27cf13db2f.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 2", "caption": "", "mediaId": "dda0efe8-79b1-5bfd-978a-ab27cf13db2f"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/eec48037-214b-5e2d-9bf0-6321e23abd45.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 3", "caption": "", "mediaId": "eec48037-214b-5e2d-9bf0-6321e23abd45"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/253d5c85-6b9e-558a-ba23-c0f7e0a6f287.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 4", "caption": "", "mediaId": "253d5c85-6b9e-558a-ba23-c0f7e0a6f287"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/2c888971-c13b-5979-a279-9e2696f5ff81.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 5", "caption": "", "mediaId": "2c888971-c13b-5979-a279-9e2696f5ff81"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/d4f25f8d-71f5-5158-bdbc-23bcb6e7cb64.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 6", "caption": "", "mediaId": "d4f25f8d-71f5-5158-bdbc-23bcb6e7cb64"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Jour 2 — Sutures chirurgicales"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Une journée placée sous le signe de la précision et de la concentration : les participants ont découvert puis pratiqué les techniques de suture sur pads de simulation et pièces anatomiques."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/a7fd5c46-1d4b-5c68-90ec-e3d93460ebcd.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 7", "caption": "", "mediaId": "a7fd5c46-1d4b-5c68-90ec-e3d93460ebcd"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/81ed3c51-1c15-55fe-897f-f3e051c7e9dd.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 8", "caption": "", "mediaId": "81ed3c51-1c15-55fe-897f-f3e051c7e9dd"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/2b4c0230-affd-5e65-9eb4-723f04ac893d.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 9", "caption": "", "mediaId": "2b4c0230-affd-5e65-9eb4-723f04ac893d"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/e00315d1-fc4e-5625-879a-da7a21bbe857.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 10", "caption": "", "mediaId": "e00315d1-fc4e-5625-879a-da7a21bbe857"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/883d3073-b995-573f-aa55-8e993bd03fc1.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 11", "caption": "", "mediaId": "883d3073-b995-573f-aa55-8e993bd03fc1"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/a419fe6e-5a95-58aa-8567-dc915fe7806d.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 12", "caption": "", "mediaId": "a419fe6e-5a95-58aa-8567-dc915fe7806d"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Jour 3 — Vendeur en pharmacie"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les bases du métier : conseiller, orienter et accompagner les patients vers un usage responsable et adapté des médicaments."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/3981f42e-23fa-5bd4-b4a8-4449db29b641.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 13", "caption": "", "mediaId": "3981f42e-23fa-5bd4-b4a8-4449db29b641"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/53b3689e-7ec1-57a2-a268-68b8b7e5295b.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 14", "caption": "", "mediaId": "53b3689e-7ec1-57a2-a268-68b8b7e5295b"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/7316bed2-8ed9-5571-bbcb-2217df6e4460.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 15", "caption": "", "mediaId": "7316bed2-8ed9-5571-bbcb-2217df6e4460"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/38c34348-991d-5a28-87de-1e376091a633.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 16", "caption": "", "mediaId": "38c34348-991d-5a28-87de-1e376091a633"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/ba168b0d-660a-5a7c-89b4-d3a62ab70d07.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 17", "caption": "", "mediaId": "ba168b0d-660a-5a7c-89b4-d3a62ab70d07"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/ae6e247b-fc0c-55b7-b4ac-081edf07591a.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 18", "caption": "", "mediaId": "ae6e247b-fc0c-55b7-b4ac-081edf07591a"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "video", "attrs": {"provider": "file", "src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/af6dacb5-f729-52dc-be37-e1b88a30fda8-v2.mp4", "poster": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/bfb5f9ec-5431-501d-be3b-da3e2437376a-v2.webp", "title": "Stitch It Up 3 — le récap", "caption": "", "loop": false}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Merci !"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Avec fierté et reconnaissance, nous remercions nos formateurs pour leur professionnalisme, nos sponsors pour leur soutien et leur confiance, et tous les participants pour leur présence et leur engagement. Bravo à notre équipe pour cette organisation réussie."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/b47304d5-c704-5700-9e23-9d133858af06.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 19", "caption": "", "mediaId": "b47304d5-c704-5700-9e23-9d133858af06"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/533aa76f-38f9-55d9-846d-4b1b9efc922f.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 20", "caption": "", "mediaId": "533aa76f-38f9-55d9-846d-4b1b9efc922f"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/f68e2910-683a-51bb-a39e-af233e85ba29.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 21", "caption": "", "mediaId": "f68e2910-683a-51bb-a39e-af233e85ba29"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/6fc3dec2-fb9f-5186-9c69-141f5b194992.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 22", "caption": "", "mediaId": "6fc3dec2-fb9f-5186-9c69-141f5b194992"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/08d9412b-fe22-59b8-88e1-03dc7f135537.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 23", "caption": "", "mediaId": "08d9412b-fe22-59b8-88e1-03dc7f135537"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/060156e7-bb2c-5b3e-a23c-2663d9dc9693.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 24", "caption": "", "mediaId": "060156e7-bb2c-5b3e-a23c-2663d9dc9693"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/b65e0a3e-9ad5-5a40-bfee-033787a0bf3a.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 25", "caption": "", "mediaId": "b65e0a3e-9ad5-5a40-bfee-033787a0bf3a"}], "layout": "carousel", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/b8be3a8b-86d5-53cb-a5d7-c3d9d126dc35.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 26", "caption": "", "mediaId": "b8be3a8b-86d5-53cb-a5d7-c3d9d126dc35"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/5024fa2d-cf3b-52bd-b0b0-49a776dff448.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 27", "caption": "", "mediaId": "5024fa2d-cf3b-52bd-b0b0-49a776dff448"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/29070c9c-5dab-5c5e-bd6c-fb06e812b7cf.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 28", "caption": "", "mediaId": "29070c9c-5dab-5c5e-bd6c-fb06e812b7cf"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}]}$q$::jsonb, $q${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "For its "}, {"type": "text", "text": "3rd edition", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", Stitch It Up brought students and trainers together around one simple goal: learning skills by practising them. Between serious simulations and laughter between exercises, everyone left with solid skills."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Day 1 — Injections, blood draws and first aid"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A day to master injection and blood-draw techniques, then first-aid skills: recovery position, CPR and what to do in an emergency."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/42d431d3-b6d7-5351-b73c-bd507d3bc2ac.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 1", "caption": "", "mediaId": "42d431d3-b6d7-5351-b73c-bd507d3bc2ac"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/dda0efe8-79b1-5bfd-978a-ab27cf13db2f.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 2", "caption": "", "mediaId": "dda0efe8-79b1-5bfd-978a-ab27cf13db2f"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/eec48037-214b-5e2d-9bf0-6321e23abd45.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 3", "caption": "", "mediaId": "eec48037-214b-5e2d-9bf0-6321e23abd45"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/253d5c85-6b9e-558a-ba23-c0f7e0a6f287.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 4", "caption": "", "mediaId": "253d5c85-6b9e-558a-ba23-c0f7e0a6f287"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/2c888971-c13b-5979-a279-9e2696f5ff81.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 5", "caption": "", "mediaId": "2c888971-c13b-5979-a279-9e2696f5ff81"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/d4f25f8d-71f5-5158-bdbc-23bcb6e7cb64.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 6", "caption": "", "mediaId": "d4f25f8d-71f5-5158-bdbc-23bcb6e7cb64"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Day 2 — Surgical sutures"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A day of precision and focus: participants discovered and practised suturing techniques on simulation pads and anatomical specimens."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/a7fd5c46-1d4b-5c68-90ec-e3d93460ebcd.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 7", "caption": "", "mediaId": "a7fd5c46-1d4b-5c68-90ec-e3d93460ebcd"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/81ed3c51-1c15-55fe-897f-f3e051c7e9dd.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 8", "caption": "", "mediaId": "81ed3c51-1c15-55fe-897f-f3e051c7e9dd"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/2b4c0230-affd-5e65-9eb4-723f04ac893d.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 9", "caption": "", "mediaId": "2b4c0230-affd-5e65-9eb4-723f04ac893d"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/e00315d1-fc4e-5625-879a-da7a21bbe857.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 10", "caption": "", "mediaId": "e00315d1-fc4e-5625-879a-da7a21bbe857"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/883d3073-b995-573f-aa55-8e993bd03fc1.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 11", "caption": "", "mediaId": "883d3073-b995-573f-aa55-8e993bd03fc1"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/a419fe6e-5a95-58aa-8567-dc915fe7806d.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 12", "caption": "", "mediaId": "a419fe6e-5a95-58aa-8567-dc915fe7806d"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Day 3 — Pharmacy counter skills"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The fundamentals of the job: advising, guiding and supporting patients towards a responsible and appropriate use of medicines."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/3981f42e-23fa-5bd4-b4a8-4449db29b641.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 13", "caption": "", "mediaId": "3981f42e-23fa-5bd4-b4a8-4449db29b641"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/53b3689e-7ec1-57a2-a268-68b8b7e5295b.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 14", "caption": "", "mediaId": "53b3689e-7ec1-57a2-a268-68b8b7e5295b"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/7316bed2-8ed9-5571-bbcb-2217df6e4460.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 15", "caption": "", "mediaId": "7316bed2-8ed9-5571-bbcb-2217df6e4460"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/38c34348-991d-5a28-87de-1e376091a633.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 16", "caption": "", "mediaId": "38c34348-991d-5a28-87de-1e376091a633"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9d4e8fa3-4f7c-52a9-b6c5-21d155c2b400/ba168b0d-660a-5a7c-89b4-d3a62ab70d07.webp", "alt": "Stitch It Up 3 — photo 17", "caption": "", "mediaId": "ba168b0d-660a-5a7c-89b4-d3a62ab