values ($q$6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82$q$, $q$journee-nationale-pneumologie-2026$q$, $q$3e Journée nationale de pneumologie$q$, $q$3rd National Pneumology Day$q$, $q$Deux jours scientifiques consacrés aux maladies respiratoires, organisés par le service de pneumologie avec le Life Savers Club.$q$, $q$Two scientific days on respiratory diseases, organised by the pneumology department with Life Savers Club.$q$, $q$Auditorium, Faculté de médecine, Tlemcen$q$, $q$2026-03-26 08:30+01$q$, $q$2026-03-27 17:00+01$q$, $q$https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/bb5eaa62-f6e7-5df5-a16d-eb198ec85c24.webp$q$, $q$L'équipe d'organisation de la 3e Journée nationale de pneumologie$q$, $q${"x": 50, "y": 50}$q$::jsonb, $q${"primary": "#0e7490", "accent": "#2d74ba", "background": "#ffffff", "text": "#231f20", "font": "sans", "radius": "round", "header": "gradient", "headerLayout": "fullBleed", "overlay": 45}$q$::jsonb, false, 0, $q$[{"value": "3e", "label_fr": "édition nationale", "label_en": "national edition", "icon": "award"}, {"value": "2", "label_fr": "jours scientifiques", "label_en": "scientific days", "icon": "calendar"}]$q$::jsonb, array[$q$Science$q$, $q$Pneumologie$q$, $q$Congrès$q$]::text[], $q${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Et si vos poumons s'arrêtaient demain ?", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " La santé respiratoire n'a jamais été aussi importante, et la sensibilisation est le premier pas vers la prévention."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le service de pneumologie de la Faculté de médecine de Tlemcen, sous l'égide de la Société algérienne de pneumologie et en collaboration avec le Life Savers Club, a organisé la "}, {"type": "text", "text": "3e Journée nationale des maladies respiratoires", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " les 26 et 27 mars 2026."}]}, {"type": "video", "attrs": {"provider": "file", "src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/e08ad8a1-768f-5922-9428-ff2b1ea7c2bf-v2.mp4", "poster": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/49a7c044-127e-58f3-85a2-0f48250ea67d-v2.webp", "title": "Le teaser", "caption": "", "loop": false}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La parole aux intervenants"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le Dr Djenfi et le Dr Benmansour reviennent sur ces deux journées et remercient toutes celles et ceux qui ont contribué à leur réussite."}]}, {"type": "columns", "content": [{"type": "column", "content": [{"type": "video", "attrs": {"provider": "file", "src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/3f60b74e-5f36-53df-a97c-97fcfc4a81f4-v2.mp4", "poster": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/f9670ffe-26f9-584d-8d43-15d8f8910707-v2.webp", "title": "Le mot du Dr Djenfi", "caption": "", "loop": false}}]}, {"type": "column", "content": [{"type": "video", "attrs": {"provider": "file", "src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/6b3c589c-4969-547b-a020-d6c0f8292e21-v2.mp4", "poster": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/d361e748-e899-551b-a351-c4112171f46d-v2.webp", "title": "Le mot du Dr Benmansour", "caption": "", "loop": false}}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L'équipe"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Un groupe engagé qui a participé à l'organisation de cette journée scientifique avec sérieux et esprit d'équipe. Fiers de chaque membre ayant pris part à cette expérience."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/2bf0adc6-a72d-5c24-a860-4acc3a2b543c.webp", "alt": "3e Journée nationale de pneumologie — photo 1", "caption": "", "mediaId": "2bf0adc6-a72d-5c24-a860-4acc3a2b543c"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/02a85750-d3ef-551d-9c04-aece3b279cce.webp", "alt": "3e Journée nationale de pneumologie — photo 2", "caption": "", "mediaId": "02a85750-d3ef-551d-9c04-aece3b279cce"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/aabaa8aa-8734-53d0-858e-60b6206079da.webp", "alt": "3e Journée nationale de pneumologie — photo 3", "caption": "", "mediaId": "aabaa8aa-8734-53d0-858e-60b6206079da"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/b433e274-89f6-5c78-bb1b-238f76906269.webp", "alt": "3e Journée nationale de pneumologie — photo 4", "caption": "", "mediaId": "b433e274-89f6-5c78-bb1b-238f76906269"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/35691f63-2740-521d-9fa2-1838bf74f7b3.webp", "alt": "3e Journée nationale de pneumologie — photo 5", "caption": "", "mediaId": "35691f63-2740-521d-9fa2-1838bf74f7b3"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/53892291-b5c6-51a4-8d2e-45c4cba4862f.webp", "alt": "3e Journée nationale de pneumologie — photo 6", "caption": "", "mediaId": "53892291-b5c6-51a4-8d2e-45c4cba4862f"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}]}$q$::jsonb, $q${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What if your lungs stopped working tomorrow?", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Respiratory health has never mattered more, and awareness is the first step towards prevention."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The pneumology department of the Faculty of Medicine of Tlemcen, under the auspices of the Algerian Society of Pneumology and with Life Savers Club, organised the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "3rd National Day of Respiratory Diseases", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " on March 26 and 27, 2026."}]}, {"type": "video", "attrs": {"provider": "file", "src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/e08ad8a1-768f-5922-9428-ff2b1ea7c2bf-v2.mp4", "poster": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/49a7c044-127e-58f3-85a2-0f48250ea67d-v2.webp", "title": "The teaser", "caption": "", "loop": false}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A word from the speakers"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dr Djenfi and Dr Benmansour look back on these two days and thank everyone who contributed to their success."}]}, {"type": "columns", "content": [{"type": "column", "content": [{"type": "video", "attrs": {"provider": "file", "src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/3f60b74e-5f36-53df-a97c-97fcfc4a81f4-v2.mp4", "poster": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/f9670ffe-26f9-584d-8d43-15d8f8910707-v2.webp", "title": "A word from Dr Djenfi", "caption": "", "loop": false}}]}, {"type": "column", "content": [{"type": "video", "attrs": {"provider": "file", "src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/6b3c589c-4969-547b-a020-d6c0f8292e21-v2.mp4", "poster": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/d361e748-e899-551b-a351-c4112171f46d-v2.webp", "title": "A word from Dr Benmansour", "caption": "", "loop": false}}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The team"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A committed group who helped organise this scientific day with dedication and team spirit. Proud of every member who took part."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/2bf0adc6-a72d-5c24-a860-4acc3a2b543c.webp", "alt": "3rd National Pneumology Day — photo 1", "caption": "", "mediaId": "2bf0adc6-a72d-5c24-a860-4acc3a2b543c"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/02a85750-d3ef-551d-9c04-aece3b279cce.webp", "alt": "3rd National Pneumology Day — photo 2", "caption": "", "mediaId": "02a85750-d3ef-551d-9c04-aece3b279cce"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/aabaa8aa-8734-53d0-858e-60b6206079da.webp", "alt": "3rd National Pneumology Day — photo 3", "caption": "", "mediaId": "aabaa8aa-8734-53d0-858e-60b6206079da"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/b433e274-89f6-5c78-bb1b-238f76906269.webp", "alt": "3rd National Pneumology Day — photo 4", "caption": "", "mediaId": "b433e274-89f6-5c78-bb1b-238f76906269"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/35691f63-2740-521d-9fa2-1838bf74f7b3.webp", "alt": "3rd National Pneumology Day — photo 5", "caption": "", "mediaId": "35691f63-2740-521d-9fa2-1838bf74f7b3"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/6d38ceef-f7c2-5c55-b7b0-168f063eae82/53892291-b5c6-51a4-8d2e-45c4cba4862f.webp", "alt": "3rd National Pneumology Day — photo 6", "caption": "", "mediaId": "53892291-b5c6-51a4-8d2e-45c4cba4862f"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}]}$q$::jsonb, $q${"instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DWzHYxhDSOS/"}$q$::jsonb, 'draft')
