values ($q$9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4$q$, $q$differents-mais-uniques-centre-autisme-aat$q$, $q$Différents mais uniques — Journées au Centre d'autisme AAT$q$, $q$Different but unique — Days at the AAT Autism Centre$q$, $q$Peinture, maquillage, jeux et atelier cupcakes : des journées de partage avec les enfants du Centre d'autisme AAT de Tlemcen.$q$, $q$Painting, face painting, games and a cupcake workshop: days of sharing with the children of the AAT Autism Centre in Tlemcen.$q$, $q$Centre d'autisme AAT, Tlemcen$q$, $q$2026-02-12 10:00+01$q$, $q$2026-02-14 16:00+01$q$, $q$https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/ac01ac14-6e29-5859-891d-2566fe8560da.webp$q$, $q$Une membre du club maquille un enfant au Centre d'autisme AAT$q$, $q${"x": 50, "y": 40}$q$::jsonb, $q${}$q$::jsonb, false, 0, $q$[]$q$::jsonb, array[$q$Solidarité$q$, $q$Autisme$q$, $q$Enfance$q$]::text[], $q${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "En partenariat avec le "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Centre d'autisme AAT", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " de Tlemcen, le Life Savers Club a partagé plusieurs journées de créativité, de rires et de complicité avec les enfants du centre. Parce que lorsque la passion rencontre le sens, on crée un bel impact."}]}, {"type": "video", "attrs": {"provider": "file", "src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/30caf778-4113-534b-b162-e5b1bf7cfc16-v2.mp4", "poster": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/48ef426a-2b9d-566a-b727-3d9c51745b98-v2.webp", "title": "Différents mais uniques", "caption": "", "loop": false}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Jour 1 — Couleurs et créativité"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Peinture, coloriage, moulins à vent, empreintes de mains, maquillage et la visite d'un clown : la salle s'est remplie de couleurs et de sourires. Bien plus que du dessin, c'était un moment de partage où chaque sourire comptait."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/fea00c2c-6c4c-50cb-94a2-72d338f77c8a.webp", "alt": "Différents mais uniques — photo 1", "caption": "", "mediaId": "fea00c2c-6c4c-50cb-94a2-72d338f77c8a"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/e6bee36e-244d-569c-a0df-f6956ddb6c58.webp", "alt": "Différents mais uniques — photo 2", "caption": "", "mediaId": "e6bee36e-244d-569c-a0df-f6956ddb6c58"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/cb0e8531-ccea-5a69-85b9-84f7991870f0.webp", "alt": "Différents mais uniques — photo 3", "caption": "", "mediaId": "cb0e8531-ccea-5a69-85b9-84f7991870f0"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/88a06e4c-6803-5e9d-8277-28cc4fd89da5.webp", "alt": "Différents mais uniques — photo 4", "caption": "", "mediaId": "88a06e4c-6803-5e9d-8277-28cc4fd89da5"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/b449220e-b2bb-5a2b-919a-57f86f4d790e.webp", "alt": "Différents mais uniques — photo 5", "caption": "", "mediaId": "b449220e-b2bb-5a2b-919a-57f86f4d790e"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/92f09d1c-fea0-524c-a991-5551ec437f86.webp", "alt": "Différents mais uniques — photo 6", "caption": "", "mediaId": "92f09d1c-fea0-524c-a991-5551ec437f86"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Atelier cupcakes"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Toques sur la tête, les enfants et nos membres ont pâtissé ensemble : mesurer, mélanger, verser, enfourner… Préparer des cupcakes, construire de l'espoir et créer des sourires."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/770cba0c-05d8-56fc-a9c0-4bd754fb2d37.webp", "alt": "Différents mais uniques — photo 7", "caption": "", "mediaId": "770cba0c-05d8-56fc-a9c0-4bd754fb2d37"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/b3fd371b-7ad9-5881-ba33-200afe23d6f7.webp", "alt": "Différents mais uniques — photo 8", "caption": "", "mediaId": "b3fd371b-7ad9-5881-ba33-200afe23d6f7"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/ee233117-24bd-5365-ad0e-2dc8cd3c4692.webp", "alt": "Différents mais uniques — photo 9", "caption": "", "mediaId": "ee233117-24bd-5365-ad0e-2dc8cd3c4692"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/44db6f2b-0552-5695-83e2-d098824befc4.webp", "alt": "Différents mais uniques — photo 10", "caption": "", "mediaId": "44db6f2b-0552-5695-83e2-d098824befc4"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/9fbda53f-64b6-5b6e-be4d-56b1e6f624e4.webp", "alt": "Différents mais uniques — photo 11", "caption": "", "mediaId": "9fbda53f-64b6-5b6e-be4d-56b1e6f624e4"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/ff4d8d08-e129-53bf-9f84-e69d02a495cd.webp", "alt": "Différents mais uniques — photo 12", "caption": "", "mediaId": "ff4d8d08-e129-53bf-9f84-e69d02a495cd"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "callout", "attrs": {"tone": "heart", "color": null}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ensemble, nous avons partagé de la joie, soutenu l'épanouissement des enfants et rappelé que la bienveillance fait toute la différence. Des journées que nous garderons toujours en mémoire."}]}]}]}$q$::jsonb, $q${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "In partnership with the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "AAT Autism Centre", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " in Tlemcen, Life Savers Club shared several days of creativity, laughter and connection with the children of the centre. Because when passion meets purpose, beautiful impact is created."}]}, {"type": "video", "attrs": {"provider": "file", "src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/30caf778-4113-534b-b162-e5b1bf7cfc16-v2.mp4", "poster": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/48ef426a-2b9d-566a-b727-3d9c51745b98-v2.webp", "title": "Different but unique", "caption": "", "loop": false}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Day 1 — Colours and creativity"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Painting, colouring, pinwheels, handprints, face painting and a visit from a clown: the room filled with colours and smiles. More than drawing, it was a moment of sharing where every smile counted."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/fea00c2c-6c4c-50cb-94a2-72d338f77c8a.webp", "alt": "Different but unique — photo 1", "caption": "", "mediaId": "fea00c2c-6c4c-50cb-94a2-72d338f77c8a"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/e6bee36e-244d-569c-a0df-f6956ddb6c58.webp", "alt": "Different but unique — photo 2", "caption": "", "mediaId": "e6bee36e-244d-569c-a0df-f6956ddb6c58"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/cb0e8531-ccea-5a69-85b9-84f7991870f0.webp", "alt": "Different but unique — photo 3", "caption": "", "mediaId": "cb0e8531-ccea-5a69-85b9-84f7991870f0"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/88a06e4c-6803-5e9d-8277-28cc4fd89da5.webp", "alt": "Different but unique — photo 4", "caption": "", "mediaId": "88a06e4c-6803-5e9d-8277-28cc4fd89da5"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/b449220e-b2bb-5a2b-919a-57f86f4d790e.webp", "alt": "Different but unique — photo 5", "caption": "", "mediaId": "b449220e-b2bb-5a2b-919a-57f86f4d790e"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/92f09d1c-fea0-524c-a991-5551ec437f86.webp", "alt": "Different but unique — photo 6", "caption": "", "mediaId": "92f09d1c-fea0-524c-a991-5551ec437f86"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cupcake workshop"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chef hats on, the children and our members baked together: measuring, mixing, pouring, into the oven… Baking cupcakes, building hope, creating smiles."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/770cba0c-05d8-56fc-a9c0-4bd754fb2d37.webp", "alt": "Different but unique — photo 7", "caption": "", "mediaId": "770cba0c-05d8-56fc-a9c0-4bd754fb2d37"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/b3fd371b-7ad9-5881-ba33-200afe23d6f7.webp", "alt": "Different but unique — photo 8", "caption": "", "mediaId": "b3fd371b-7ad9-5881-ba33-200afe23d6f7"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/ee233117-24bd-5365-ad0e-2dc8cd3c4692.webp", "alt": "Different but unique — photo 9", "caption": "", "mediaId": "ee233117-24bd-5365-ad0e-2dc8cd3c4692"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/44db6f2b-0552-5695-83e2-d098824befc4.webp", "alt": "Different but unique — photo 10", "caption": "", "mediaId": "44db6f2b-0552-5695-83e2-d098824befc4"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/9fbda53f-64b6-5b6e-be4d-56b1e6f624e4.webp", "alt": "Different but unique — photo 11", "caption": "", "mediaId": "9fbda53f-64b6-5b6e-be4d-56b1e6f624e4"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/9cfbb2d7-3105-526a-b57d-a49a36e1f3d4/ff4d8d08-e129-53bf-9f84-e69d02a495cd.webp", "alt": "Different but unique — photo 12", "caption": "", "mediaId": "ff4d8d08-e129-53bf-9f84-e69d02a495cd"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "callout", "attrs": {"tone": "heart", "color": null}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Together we shared joy, supported the children's growth and remembered that kindness makes all the difference. Days we will always cherish."}]}]}]}$q$::jsonb, $q${"instagram": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DUqyMqCDYCo/"}$q$::jsonb, 'draft')
