values ($q$f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af$q$, $q$life-savers-airlines-2025$q$, $q$Life Savers Airlines — Un tour du monde sans quitter la fac$q$, $q$Life Savers Airlines — A world tour without leaving campus$q$, $q$Une journée culturelle où chaque stand représentait un pays : traditions, saveurs, costumes et jeux à la Faculté de médecine.$q$, $q$A cultural day where every stand was a country: traditions, flavours, costumes and games at the Faculty of Medicine.$q$, $q$Faculté de médecine, Tlemcen$q$, $q$2025-05-27 09:30+01$q$, null, $q$https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/45f82c44-fb62-5b09-bf54-184257bc7def.webp$q$, $q$Des membres et des visiteurs autour d'un stand de Life Savers Airlines$q$, $q${"x": 50, "y": 45}$q$::jsonb, $q${"primary": "#0e7490", "accent": "#2d74ba", "background": "#ffffff", "text": "#231f20", "font": "sans", "radius": "round", "header": "gradient", "headerLayout": "fullBleed", "overlay": 45}$q$::jsonb, false, 0, $q$[]$q$::jsonb, array[$q$Culture$q$, $q$Vie du club$q$]::text[], $q${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Attention passagers, attachez vos ceintures !", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Le 27 mai 2025, Life Savers Airlines a décollé depuis la Faculté de médecine pour un voyage culturel autour du monde, sans quitter son siège."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/c19d84fb-afad-5188-9fe6-56a399deab8b.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 1", "caption": "", "mediaId": "c19d84fb-afad-5188-9fe6-56a399deab8b"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/824b7733-8638-5e46-b2c6-bb058d38e37b.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 2", "caption": "", "mediaId": "824b7733-8638-5e46-b2c6-bb058d38e37b"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 2}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Embarquement immédiat"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Algérie, Égypte, Palestine, Espagne, Royaume-Uni, Italie, Chine, Japon, États-Unis… Chaque stand faisait découvrir un pays à travers ses traditions, ses saveurs, ses costumes et ses jeux."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/7a70249b-910c-53b9-899e-6c312665912c.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 3", "caption": "", "mediaId": "7a70249b-910c-53b9-899e-6c312665912c"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/24ac7690-fe6c-56ee-af9a-53f339378761.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 4", "caption": "", "mediaId": "24ac7690-fe6c-56ee-af9a-53f339378761"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/90b4739a-c54f-5fb6-a735-a7695e6ba558.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 5", "caption": "", "mediaId": "90b4739a-c54f-5fb6-a735-a7695e6ba558"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/8a08aa47-6d88-54cd-bd0a-8c114ae7ba6d.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 6", "caption": "", "mediaId": "8a08aa47-6d88-54cd-bd0a-8c114ae7ba6d"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/d40624ff-e227-557d-8c33-32c189446661.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 7", "caption": "", "mediaId": "d40624ff-e227-557d-8c33-32c189446661"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/5fb8eedf-1153-57bf-9aae-b7731ceeb4ed.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 8", "caption": "", "mediaId": "5fb8eedf-1153-57bf-9aae-b7731ceeb4ed"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/751314fa-680c-5182-a2e9-75ba05a67990.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 9", "caption": "", "mediaId": "751314fa-680c-5182-a2e9-75ba05a67990"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/bd4b6244-e83d-5985-aeb0-48d5f4b7ec49.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 10", "caption": "", "mediaId": "bd4b6244-e83d-5985-aeb0-48d5f4b7ec49"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/89bb1237-408e-5861-b360-a4fbebf26caf.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 11", "caption": "", "mediaId": "89bb1237-408e-5861-b360-a4fbebf26caf"}], "layout": "masonry", "columns": 3}}, {"type": "video", "attrs": {"provider": "file", "src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/b3c0cc4e-9f4b-565b-9f88-1fd240700308-v2.mp4", "poster": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/239ed053-ce84-5ebe-8012-1ee339b1031c-v2.webp", "title": "Préparez vos valises…", "caption": "", "loop": false}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Merci à notre équipage"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Un grand merci à tous les membres qui ont fait vivre cet événement : votre présence, votre énergie et votre esprit d'équipe ont créé une ambiance magnifique du début à la fin. Et merci aussi à celles et ceux qui ont aidé en coulisses — ce succès nous appartient à tous."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/633c4bef-cca4-5998-b087-f5e68c245d1a.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 12", "caption": "", "mediaId": "633c4bef-cca4-5998-b087-f5e68c245d1a"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/a3d10b64-38a0-53ad-8117-e5944e51ab06.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 13", "caption": "", "mediaId": "a3d10b64-38a0-53ad-8117-e5944e51ab06"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/9ce4251e-64a9-57d6-a37a-c13886032096.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 14", "caption": "", "mediaId": "9ce4251e-64a9-57d6-a37a-c13886032096"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/c409e054-77bb-5b0d-9eab-45096cf3a94a.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 15", "caption": "", "mediaId": "c409e054-77bb-5b0d-9eab-45096cf3a94a"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/e56ca630-cc81-5e7d-88fe-3ad47c328ee7.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 16", "caption": "", "mediaId": "e56ca630-cc81-5e7d-88fe-3ad47c328ee7"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/5f2dc5f8-b453-5f93-933e-476939ddb415.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 17", "caption": "", "mediaId": "5f2dc5f8-b453-5f93-933e-476939ddb415"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/506c4518-e2f2-5aba-96b8-5463887b2cfe.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 18", "caption": "", "mediaId": "506c4518-e2f2-5aba-96b8-5463887b2cfe"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/761cc70d-c32e-5778-8a97-e31d5cf87a3a.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 19", "caption": "", "mediaId": "761cc70d-c32e-5778-8a97-e31d5cf87a3a"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/0460d5e3-9b9b-52f7-a621-eac6041c90d0.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 20", "caption": "", "mediaId": "0460d5e3-9b9b-52f7-a621-eac6041c90d0"}], "layout": "carousel", "columns": 3}}]}$q$::jsonb, $q${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Attention passengers, fasten your seatbelts!", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " On May 27, 2025, Life Savers Airlines took off from the Faculty of Medicine for a cultural journey around the world — without leaving your seat."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/c19d84fb-afad-5188-9fe6-56a399deab8b.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 1", "caption": "", "mediaId": "c19d84fb-afad-5188-9fe6-56a399deab8b"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/824b7733-8638-5e46-b2c6-bb058d38e37b.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 2", "caption": "", "mediaId": "824b7733-8638-5e46-b2c6-bb058d38e37b"}], "layout": "grid", "columns": 2}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Now boarding"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Algeria, Egypt, Palestine, Spain, the United Kingdom, Italy, China, Japan, the United States… Every stand introduced a country through its traditions, flavours, costumes and games."}]}, {"type": "gallery", "attrs": {"images": [{"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/7a70249b-910c-53b9-899e-6c312665912c.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 3", "caption": "", "mediaId": "7a70249b-910c-53b9-899e-6c312665912c"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/24ac7690-fe6c-56ee-af9a-53f339378761.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 4", "caption": "", "mediaId": "24ac7690-fe6c-56ee-af9a-53f339378761"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/90b4739a-c54f-5fb6-a735-a7695e6ba558.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 5", "caption": "", "mediaId": "90b4739a-c54f-5fb6-a735-a7695e6ba558"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/8a08aa47-6d88-54cd-bd0a-8c114ae7ba6d.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 6", "caption": "", "mediaId": "8a08aa47-6d88-54cd-bd0a-8c114ae7ba6d"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/d40624ff-e227-557d-8c33-32c189446661.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 7", "caption": "", "mediaId": "d40624ff-e227-557d-8c33-32c189446661"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/5fb8eedf-1153-57bf-9aae-b7731ceeb4ed.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 8", "caption": "", "mediaId": "5fb8eedf-1153-57bf-9aae-b7731ceeb4ed"}, {"src": "https://kvqcnvbdzqxmvffipkui.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-media/events/f994b373-b005-5f85-80af-57fadb85a5af/751314fa-680c-5182-a2e9-75ba05a67990.webp", "alt": "Life Savers Airlines — photo 9", "caption": "", "mediaId": "751314fa-680c-5182-a2e9-75ba05a67990"}, {"src